      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS ENVY (4) recorded a win over 715m at Sandown in an outstanding 41.57 last start. In winning form and can measure up again. MEPUNGA DONNA (2) jumped from this box and placed in a Grade 4/5 at Sandown over 715m last time, finishing 1.3 lengths from the winner (42.07). Has a strong record off this same draw including three wins. Has the ability and can measure up. LAKEVIEW IAN (5) has a big motor and ideally suited at the longer trips. Was a strong winner last time (41.98) over 715m at Sandown in a Grade 4/5. Has a strong record at this distance including two wins. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Hard to fault his form and he makes plenty of appeal. IN MODERATION (7) looks an each-way chance.",
